/* boot0.pgc B2f self-host step6: read v3 program text (stdin) -> emit i386 AT&T .s (eggless; self-derived)
   face: + do-while / break / continue (loop label stack lcs/lbl by depth ld) /
   block scope ({} shadow outer, pop-back + addl $4k stack reclaim, per-function sc reset) /
   comparison ops == != < <= > >= (setCC) / if-else else-if / while / for (scan-replay inc) /
   return / calls / decl-assign (v1-v2 carried); L%d jump labels; self-recursive p_s stmt parser
   (blocks/control flow inlined, no mutual recursion); main() return printed.
   workarounds kept: nested-if lexer (pggcc4 >=3-way || defect), fi sentinel s==-1, one-arg scan init,
   ast-stack saves argp/endp for nested calls, ar depth counter, driver loops keep if inside helpers (D16),
   ns semicolon-strictness flag (if/while/for/block skip ';' requirement, else/return/decl/do/break/continue strict),
   for-loop incf empty-inc + body-token save/restore (bpos/btk/btp/btl) for inc-after-body replay,
   fi reverse search (shadow wins), bstk/blok block-base stack, pd same-scope collision check only.
   without any C/C++ compiler reference; ISO 9899:1990 6.1/6.2.1/6.3/6.6
   B4 find (2026-08-26): eh() pg_quiet gate was on print_decimal only, trailing newline
   (movl $10/call print_char) emitted unconditionally -> boot0-built targets printed 1 stray
   "\n" even with pg_quiet=1 (pggcc4 v4.1 spec: skip value AND newline); fixed by gating
   newline alongside print_decimal -> bin0/bin1/bin2 self-compile outputs byte-identical.
   B5-1 face (2026-08-26): pointer params (so_t/so_p typed param table in pfun; pd() locals
   so_t/so_p=0), ptr-param subscript read/write in e_expr/p_a (fi_i = index lookup; fi() returns
   slot OFFSET so[i], not index - new subscript paths must use fi_i), wpf(char-ptr,int) self-used
   to emit f%/g%/str% labels (literal args self-exercise). E5: pggcc4 MAX_STR 256->512
   (136 unique literals x ~1.9 lex-replay > 256). run_boot 100/100, closure intact.
   P4-II (2026-08-26, chain): T1 const/volatile absorb + ptr declarators (multi-* & *+[N], gptr/pdlv);
   T2 ternary ?: (tn/tbd/tbs, branches keep opn, RPAREN/tail-drain tolerate enclosing parens) +
   comma-expr (ar==0 or inside parens) + sizeof (type/ident/global-array);
   T3 bitwise & | ^ ~ << >> + % (C precedence pr 5..-4; idivl rem in %edx; shl/shr use %cl);
   T4 switch/case/default (pre-scan case-consts -> compare chain + in-order case bodies, temp slot
   per switch, break via lcs/lbl, fallthrough by body order; swcv/swlb depth-indexed flat arrays);
   T5 enum consts (csn/csv + cstfind) + typedef aliases (tdn/tdb/tdp + tdfind) wired into
   pd/pfun/pgv/ptop_one; E6 pggcc4 MAX_GLB 128->256 (boot0 131 globals incl T_* const line);
   E6b boot0 own gst/gn/gptr 128->256 + gan 2048->4096 for self-compile. run_boot 160/160,
   closure intact.
   P4-II T6/T7 (2026-08-26, chain): T6 struct/union - type table (stt/stnm/stsz/stu/smc/
   smn/smo/smt/sms), ptop pstm layout (int 4-align, char 1, union=max, nested struct membs
   smt=2+sms), dot member read/write in e_expr/p_a (chain s.p.x, offset accumulate, char fl),
   struct-typed globals (pgsid->pgst .space stsz, gstt per-global struct id) & locals
   (p_s branch, so_st=sid+1, ceil(stsz/4) slots), whole-struct copy ecpy (compile-time
   unrolled movl/movb, local+global, direct assign), sizeof(struct/union type | var);
   T7 local 1D/2D arrays (pd [N][M] suffix -> so_sz=total/so_p=col, base so[si] lowest slot,
   addr-mode base(%ebp,%ecx[,4]) load/store read+write) + array-name decay (leal) + sizeof;
   global 2D arrays via gcol (carried). E7 pggcc4 MAX_STR 512->1024 + boot0 stp0/sts
   (print_str call count 165->265, ~1.9x rereg -> >512). run_boot 189/189, closure intact.
   P4-II 余项 (2026-08-26, chain): -> 运算符（T_ARROW）+ lexer；匿名嵌套 struct/union
   定义（pstm 递归）；struct 数组（局部/全局）+ 初始化器（pginit 递归平铺 .long/.byte，
   任意维嵌套）+ struct 参数（引用传递 so_par/so_pst）；&a[i]/&s.m（T_BAND 取址分支
   opn 隔离）；声明符括号 int (*p)[3]（pd/全局 rpflag+grp，后缀 [i] 读，数组指针 *p 不改
   读内存）；3D 数组（局部 so_p2 + 全局 gcol2，e_expr/p_a 栈式三索引，%edi 承运）。
   E8 pggcc4 MAX_STR 1024->4096；E9 pggcc4 in_buf 65536->131072（boot0.pgc 66KB+ 截断
   引发字符串"未闭合"误报）。run_boot 214/214, closure intact.
   固定点修复 (2026-08-26, B4 门1/门2 复验)：p_s 块回收 print_int((sc-bstk[bd])*4)
   （括号内下标减法再乘常数）在 bin0 自编译产物中被错译（丢 *4，回收 addl 出非 4 倍数
   $1/$2/$5）→ 门1 boot0b.s!=boot0c.s；改"先存局部 n2=sc-bstk[bd] 再 print_int(n2*4)"
   后固定点成立（boot0b.s==boot0c.s 逐字节、bin1==bin2）。登记通用约束：避免
   (局部-数组[下标])*const 复合表达式于自编译热路径。run_boot 212/212. */
